<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In 6.2. Sense Selections ‣ 6. Ablation Studies ‣ Decoder-based Sense Knowledge Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Number of selected senses during training <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>κ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS3" title="In 6. Ablation Studies ‣ Decoder-based Sense Knowledge Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3 </span>Training Hyperparameters</span></a>
