Keep rate denotes the percentage of tokenized lexical relations whose span length does not exceed <math id="S3.T2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
