<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9. </span>Effect of <math id="A3.T9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> on ARC and MMLU benchmarks across LLaMA and Mistral backbones on KD. The selected value of <math id="A3.T9.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> used in subsequent experiments is highlighted in bold.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ C.1. KD Hyparameter Ablation Study ‣ Appendix C Model Hyparameters ‣ Decoder-based Sense Knowledge Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> presents an ablation study on the hyperparameter <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>, which is defined in the standard KD objective and controls the relative weighting of the distillation loss. Based on the observed trade-off between task performance and distillation effectiveness, we select <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=1.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=1.0</annotation></semantics></math> for each backbone. To ensure a fair comparison, we then keep the same <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=1.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=1.0</annotation></semantics></math> setting when conducting all DSKD experiments.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2. </span>DSKD Hyparameter Tables</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For hyperparameter search, we explore learning rates in <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\{5\mathrm{e}{-6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{5\mathrm{e}{-6}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\mathrm{e}{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\mathrm{e}{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\mathrm{e}{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\mathrm{e}{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5\mathrm{e}{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5\mathrm{e}{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\mathrm{e}{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\mathrm{e}{-4}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m6" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="2\mathrm{e}{-4}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\mathrm{e}{-4}\}</annotation></semantics></math>. For the sampler sizes, we test values of <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa=\{1,\,5,\,10,\,15,\,20\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 15</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 20</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa=\{1,\,5,\,10,\,15,\,20\}</annotation></semantics></math>. For the loss weights <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{p},\beta_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{p},\beta_{n}</annotation></semantics></math>, we test <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{0.5,\,1.0,\,1.5,\,2.0\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 1.0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 1.5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 2.0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{0.5,\,1.0,\,1.5,\,2.0\}</annotation></semantics></math>. Table  <a href="#A3.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ C.2. DSKD Hyparameter Tables ‣ Appendix C Model Hyparameters ‣ Decoder-based Sense Knowledge Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> presents the training hyperparameters used for KD and DSKD across all tasks with the Llama-3 and Mistral models.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T10" class="ltx_table">
